  goldReward: 500
  expReward: 100
  offerDialogue:
    name: Ford
    sentences:
    - Here's what we need.
    - Build a bridge that gives our loaded cargo trucks a direct route to the construction
      site.
    - <b><#E09500>You can use that rocky section as an extra support point if you
      think it'll help</color></b>.
    - During testing, keep an eye on which parts of the bridge experience the greatest
      stress.
    - <b><#E09500>These trucks carry a lot of weight, so make sure the structure
      can handle them safely</color></b>.
    - I'll leave the design decisions to you, {PlayerName}. If you're ready, take
      the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Ford
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Ford
    sentences:
    - <b><#E09500>Those trucks aren't light. If a part of the bridge is taking too
      much stress, you might need to rethink the supports or structural arrangement</color></b>.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Ford
    sentences:
    - Now that's a route our crews can work with!
    - The trucks can head straight to the site instead of traveling through other
      routes.
    - That'll save us plenty of time on deliveries.
    - You've done us a big favor, {PlayerName}. Thanks for the help!
